  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-copycat-shadow-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "f68f3733f7a184de66fac6b9ff1f557c267ff5cc3846d6e64b1ccf4883443b8b",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "02ae3b06ed65b64eb0bab997f083ceb60a86e1cb3988a1d15fd221afde4e20a0",
      "text": "悟空的跟屁虫影子",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5942b591e13636ce38bfbddd4bb2d735262f69e3275a4fe45a3417849272ea84",
      "text": "今晚，院子里\n要演影子戏。\n沙僧在这边放一盏灯，\n在那边立一块白幕布：\n“灯和幕布都不挪动。”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1bd0a4a5b8f4b0e8e06ac8581637e70d8980af62f3ac2b343cb12b7e89f16432",
      "text": "悟空走到\n灯和幕布中间，\n甩了甩尾巴——\n幕布上也甩起一条\n大大的尾巴！\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "17e06af77a4696031672020c11bad6d500faf8695a2f06b5a15931b504aca1bc",
      "text": "悟空问：“那是谁？”\n他挥挥手，它也挥挥手；\n他跳一跳，它也跳一跳。\n“有人在学我！”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "909e0364f9188f7fcacce2e40f1fb1634daa857d2c01a4070eeccd1a446b9cd4",
      "text": "玉兔咯咯地笑：\n“那是你的影子呀。\n你把光挡住了，\n幕布上就留下\n一个黑黑的影子。”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c85cd00b90236d816ea848315dd564c1ac3cd6dc0fbadc36c19814746a5584fe",
      "text": "玉兔举起\n一根小棍上的纸猴子：\n“你们看。”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2227348cc968c9109507d6964d4401e8ffc0f267a00f24bda8f4b98a4abe667f",
      "text": "她把纸猴子\n往灯那边移近一点，\n影子变得\n越来越大！\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "85d553f8f71259d0d12b14c6d92c6cb0b368e82230b58deb3abea21aaa75d4cb",
      "text": "她再把纸猴子移得离灯远一点，\n靠近幕布，\n影子就变小了。\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ea64d9224069a36b5ef6869689f2054747c062ba2361a4105d9cab9db2105729",
      "text": "悟空拿起纸兔子试一试：\n靠近灯，变成大兔子！\n离得远，变成小兔子！\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6d083cf847e94969fbddac8c2a875a1b09cde6f35582110744930b7ebb613a34",
      "text": "大大的猴子影子\n遇到了小小的兔子影子。\n悟空说：“小兔子，你先走。”\n大猴子影子\n还鞠了一个躬。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d0bf7d0963e47dcc98f9caa1038ab07c246092e0f86a3878fd03f22aba239d88",
      "text": "八戒坐到软垫上，\n高兴地喊：“开演啦！”\n沙僧在灯旁边挥挥手。\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "008f87c1cb285511551301b450a80d69f61d8dd12b1e274085956f21be27a306",
      "text": "幕布上冒出\n两只长长的耳朵。\n玉兔问：\n“这是谁的耳朵呀？”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9be23020204fbb1168035cbe9292ee3d50d3f72b3775dd8450e363990ae9c106",
      "text": "八戒说：“是玉兔的！”\n接着又冒出两只耳朵，\n比刚才还要高。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1a8be2930c14f6a7eac6b52e9650c7f4d2db74a7fd2bbe154fb9b6cdd26392e4",
      "text": "八戒哈哈大笑：\n“那才不是耳朵，\n是悟空的两根手指！”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "90da81624fbea62a741f181c800b038af1fbbd41748aad260c294b4ec2b78c59",
      "text": "悟空和玉兔\n藏到幕布后面，\n两个影子一起\n挥手说再见。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "14175b25b9b664f7ef9cbd14f4b9d62837539110d2688a742c26e8922214efc6",
      "text": "沙僧关上灯，\n影子都不见了。\n悟空说：“学我的朋友回家啦。”\n“灯一亮，\n他就会回来！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
